"Adds `N(0, sigma)` Gaussian perturbation to a chosen dimension "
"{cite}`rechenberg1973es`"
msgstr "選ばれた次元に`N(0, sigma)`のガウス摂動を加える{cite}`rechenberg1973es`"

#: ../../../components/mutation.md
msgid "`MutationPolynomial`"
msgstr "`MutationPolynomial`"

